    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cc084d0e_7ee70d20",
        "filename": "cmd/soong_build/bazel_overlay.go",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 227,
      "author": {
        "id": 1074628
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-08-14T04:44:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we be handling the android:path tagged modules by using ExpandSources/etc too? (Not sure how easy that is outside of the module itself -- you\u0027d at least need to be passing some sort of context down)\n\nThe alternative would be to actually use information from Providers (which haven\u0027t been submitted yet) rather than the raw properties (which will be a mix of user-specified and soong-modified values). That would work a lot better for some of the desired use cases here (actually knowing which files will be used vs just what text was specified by the user, including globs and module references).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 225,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 227,
        "endChar": 3
      },
      "revId": "6abca59216029e60a0358731e0779c9475efc1c0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
